1
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,280
RESULTS ANNOUNCED AT 5:00 PM.

2
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,880
Hey, In.

3
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,600
Aren't you a little too relaxed?

4
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,040
Yeah.

5
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:32,280
I don't really care anyway.

6
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,120
I'll leave it up to fate.

7
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:38,200
During the exam, I felt so hopeless.

8
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:39,960
I don't think luck can save me.

9
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:42,480
But I saw you studying.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,720
The science program here is really famous.

11
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,400
If you get in,
you'll make some great connections.

12
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:49,320
That's a good thing.

13
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,840
Still, it feels weird.

14
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,240
You've only been at an all-boys school,

15
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,440
and now you're transferring

16
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:57,200
to a girls' school
going co-ed for the first year.

17
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,480
Isn't that like putting
a tiger in a rabbit cage?

18
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:02,600
What makes you think you're the tiger?

19
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:05,200
You could be the prey, buddy.

20
00:01:07,160 --> 00:01:09,240
Or if you don't care about studying,

21
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,200
just think of it as looking for love.

22
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,200
You're such a simp.

23
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,160
I'm serious.

24
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:19,280
At your old school,
you only saw the same people.

25
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:22,160
And meeting people
outside of school was a hassle.

26
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,440
At a new school,

27
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:25,280
you might meet someone great.

28
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,440
You just say whatever comes to mind, huh?

29
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:31,400
This is high school, man.

30
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:34,520
It's the perfect coming-of-age chapter.

31
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:42,960
Shit, it's up!

32
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,360
LOGGING IN

33
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:50,200
Please don't let me get in.

34
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,600
LIST OF ADMITTED STUDENTS

35
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,760
It's out.

36
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:02,440
Damn, I didn't get in!

37
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:03,400
You didn't either.

38
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:05,280
Wait. What are you looking at?

39
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,040
Wait, scroll up.

40
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,440
It's not there.

41
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:12,040
You idiot.

42
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,600
How could your name be there?

43
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,840
This is the Math-Arts program.

44
00:02:16,120 --> 00:02:18,160
MATH-ARTS PROGRAM

45
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:30,320
EKKACHAT HARIPOONYARAT

46
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:31,280
Holy shit!

47
00:02:31,360 --> 00:02:32,680
I got in!

48
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:35,120
So did you.

49
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:38,200
ITHADON POONYAWECH

50
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:43,160
How did I get in?

51
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:48,640
<i>Yay!…</i>

52
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,640
What?

53
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:57,240
Yay!…

54
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,960
Congratulations, Son.

55
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,120
Yay!

56
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,120
You really didn't disappoint me.

57
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:04,680
Were you eavesdropping on me?

58
00:03:04,760 --> 00:03:06,440
I wasn't eavesdropping.

59
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,520
I checked it with you.

60
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:10,120
See? Right here.

61
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:12,640
Don't forget to call Lilly.
She'll be upset.

62
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,800
Do you want anything?
I'll get it for you as a gift.

63
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:16,160
No, thanks.

64
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:19,200
Yay!

65
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,920
Dad, Mom.

66
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,720
I got in.

67
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:40,960
Alright, congratulations, Son.

68
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:43,880
<i>No…</i>

69
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:46,080
<i>What about my dream of becoming</i>
<i>a rock star with my friends?</i>

70
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,600
<i>The school life</i>
<i>I dreamed of with my friends</i>

71
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,040
<i>is about to disappear.</i>

72
00:03:59,160 --> 00:04:00,880
<i>No, Ithadon.</i>

73
00:04:01,600 --> 00:04:03,160
<i>No!</i>

74
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,440
STUDENT ID CARD

75
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,160
Tuck your shirt in, student.

76
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:44,560
Where are you?

77
00:05:45,400 --> 00:05:46,800
<i>I have no idea.</i>

78
00:05:49,720 --> 00:05:51,800
Well, once you're inside the school,

79
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:54,080
keep to the right, I guess.

80
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:56,040
I think I'm lost.

81
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,240
Where are you?

82
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,280
I'm sorry. Are you okay?

83
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:11,480
It's fine. I'm good.

84
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,680
Let's line up. Come on.

85
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:40,880
Yeah, yeah.

86
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:59,600
Do you think the girls are looking at us

87
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,200
because we're handsome
or because we're weird?

88
00:07:02,920 --> 00:07:04,880
If they're looking at me,
probably the first one.

89
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,920
If they're looking at you,
probably the second.

90
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:08,600
Asshole.

91
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:10,320
Just relax already.

92
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,440
Every change brings something good.

93
00:07:14,000 --> 00:07:15,840
Have you been watching
too many life coaches?

94
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:17,480
You're ridiculously positive.

95
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,720
Hey, hey, hey.

96
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,120
Isn't that Pinky Winky, the internet idol?

97
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,760
She's even prettier in person.

98
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:28,840
She just signed with a TV channel.

99
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,880
I saw the update in her IG bio.

100
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,360
Hey, hey, hey.

101
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:34,720
That's Ben, the national badminton player.

102
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,720
She's so cool in person.

103
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,600
Do you know everyone at this school?

104
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,200
Well, I have 5G internet.

105
00:07:41,240 --> 00:07:43,160
Might as well make good use of it.

106
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:44,880
Mind your own business.

107
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:48,400
The bell rang.

108
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:49,480
Let's line up.

109
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,360
Go put your bag away first.

110
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:05,000
<i>…Brings together the flesh and blood</i>
<i>Of the Thai people</i>

111
00:08:05,080 --> 00:08:10,200
<i>It is the people’s state</i>
<i>The land of every Thai</i>

112
00:08:10,280 --> 00:08:14,720
<i>Long maintained has been the independence</i>

113
00:08:15,280 --> 00:08:19,640
<i>Because the Thais seek, and love, unity</i>

114
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:20,760
Hey.

115
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,880
We don't sing the national anthem here.

116
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,200
See?

117
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,159
Every change brings something good.

118
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,320
Good morning, students.

119
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,760
<i>Welcome back to our school.</i>

120
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:55,280
<i>Today is the first day</i>
<i>of the new semester.</i>

121
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:56,280
<i>And more importantly,</i>

122
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:59,680
<i>this is the first year our school</i>
<i>has admitted male students.</i>

123
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:03,920
This place is way more chill
than I expected.

124
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,720
Yeah, it's a nice change.

125
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:08,160
Damn, look.

126
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:10,560
They're confessing their love.

127
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,760
Or are they drawing butts, dumbass?

128
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,920
Damn, that killed the mood.

129
00:09:29,160 --> 00:09:30,120
Lee.

130
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:31,760
Yeah?

131
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:35,040
So this is what love
at first sight feels like?

132
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:38,280
What are you on about?

133
00:09:39,400 --> 00:09:42,360
That girl next to that guy.

134
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,000
The one with the big eyes.

135
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,240
Her smile is ridiculously cute.

136
00:10:19,880 --> 00:10:21,880
Yeah, she really is cute.

137
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,520
After assembly, go get her IG for me.

138
00:10:27,120 --> 00:10:29,040
What? Go ask her yourself.

139
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:30,560
I'm too shy.

140
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,760
Oh, and I'm not?

141
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,920
Why would you be?
You're not the one who likes her.

142
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:47,440
Excuse me, ladies.

143
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:50,080
Why are you all so cute?

144
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:53,880
- Come on, Faye. Let's go.
- Faye! Faye!

145
00:10:53,960 --> 00:10:55,360
- Faye!
- Faye!

146
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,000
Faye!

147
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,080
Can I get your IG, Faye?

148
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:02,000
- Look, that's her.
- Faye!

149
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,760
Go get her IG for me.

150
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,800
No way.

151
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,280
- Hurry, go ask her yourself.
- Please.

152
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,320
Go ask her yourself.

153
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,280
No, I'm shy. Hurry up and do it for me.

154
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:11,480
- Give me your bag.
- What are you doing?

155
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:12,480
Come on, go ask her.

156
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,640
What's your name?

157
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,920
My name's Putter.

158
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,080
Whats up?

159
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,960
Oh, Putter.

160
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,520
I…

161
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,760
Can I get your IG?

162
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:00,320
My friend likes you.

163
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:04,040
Are you going to pull
the "I'm the friend" trick?

164
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:10,960
Damn it, Lee.

165
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,080
What?

166
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,520
It's not this one.

167
00:12:17,760 --> 00:12:18,960
Sorry.

168
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,240
My friend's not quite right in the head.

169
00:12:22,640 --> 00:12:23,680
It's okay.

170
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:27,640
You idiot.
What the hell is wrong with you?

171
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:29,880
You said big eyes and a sweet smile.

172
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:31,160
Wasn't that him?

173
00:12:32,040 --> 00:12:34,120
Not this one.

174
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,680
That one over there.

175
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,520
I'm heading home. Bye.

176
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:47,160
Let's go.

177
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:52,760
Sorry. See you around.

178
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:53,920
It's okay.

179
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:00,120
Who were those two?

180
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:02,600
No idea.

181
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,320
I think they asked
the wrong person for her IG.

182
00:13:05,400 --> 00:13:06,560
Oh, really?

183
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,200
Come on, get in the shot with me.

184
00:13:08,280 --> 00:13:09,600
First day of school.

185
00:13:09,680 --> 00:13:11,200
So, how is it?

186
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:13,440
- Hurry up.
- Class is starting. Stop filming.

187
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:16,400
That's the point.
It's a walking-and-talking vlog.

188
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:20,880
I shouldn't have gotten
my hopes up, damn it.

189
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,080
How was I supposed to know your keywords?

190
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:28,560
Cute, big eyes, sweet smile.

191
00:13:28,640 --> 00:13:32,080
I meant that senior girl.

192
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:33,920
Damn.

193
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,320
She's as gorgeous as seeing
PunchRakMaew in real life.

194
00:13:38,680 --> 00:13:40,120
Don't do that again.

195
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:41,640
I'll ask for her IG myself.

196
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:43,920
That's what you should've done.

197
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:53,400
Our classroom is here.

198
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:55,920
Go on.

199
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:07,400
PUTTERRR.RR
THIS ACCOUNT IS PRIVATE

200
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,360
FOLLOW - REQUESTED

201
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,320
Your classroom is right here.

202
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,000
Oh, so Room 12 is here?

203
00:14:13,640 --> 00:14:14,760
See you later, Ter.

204
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,400
This seat is free.

205
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,840
Hey.

206
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,840
Should I pick black or pink?

207
00:15:03,240 --> 00:15:05,680
If you still can't decide, I have more.

208
00:15:07,160 --> 00:15:08,480
Here.

209
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,480
Which one do you want?

210
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:16,280
I think pink suits your skin tone.

211
00:15:19,080 --> 00:15:20,480
But black is cool too.

212
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:25,240
Thanks.

213
00:15:25,760 --> 00:15:27,120
But…

214
00:15:27,200 --> 00:15:28,400
that doesn't help at all.

215
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:32,520
I think I'll go with this purple clip.

216
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,720
Purple is cuter.

217
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:38,400
Oh, right. I'm Yihwa.

218
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,800
Hi, everyone…

219
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,160
And I'm Eye.

220
00:15:45,800 --> 00:15:47,520
My name is Indy.

221
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:50,120
But you can just call me In.

222
00:15:50,200 --> 00:15:51,960
And his name is LeeIth.

223
00:15:52,640 --> 00:15:53,880
LeeIth?

224
00:15:58,120 --> 00:15:59,240
What does that mean?

225
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,680
Well, it's…

226
00:16:02,760 --> 00:16:03,640
It's because

227
00:16:03,720 --> 00:16:06,120
there are too many people named Lee.

228
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:08,760
And his real name is Ithadon,
so he's LeeIth.

229
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:12,720
Wow, you answer for each other too?

230
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:15,640
Her name is Min.

231
00:16:16,560 --> 00:16:18,640
LeeIth and Indy.

232
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,800
InLee.

233
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:22,120
This ship is definitely sailing.

234
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:31,240
What are you doing?

235
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,880
I've done worse than this.

236
00:16:35,360 --> 00:16:36,640
Damn.

237
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:38,040
You two are feeding the fans hard.

238
00:16:38,120 --> 00:16:42,040
This hardcore shipper
is about to lose her mind.

239
00:16:42,120 --> 00:16:44,680
Please, Miss Gossip Queen,

240
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:46,320
don't pretend you're not enjoying this.

241
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:51,400
See?

242
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:54,920
You laugh at the same time
and like the same things.

243
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,160
Can I borrow your personalities
for a fanfic?

244
00:16:59,520 --> 00:17:03,920
A handsome tsundere guy
and an extroverted golden retriever type.

245
00:17:07,920 --> 00:17:10,440
I think your brain
has completely melted now.

246
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:11,920
It's way past just leaking.

247
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:12,839
True.

248
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,760
The nearest mental hospital
should admit you already.

249
00:17:19,440 --> 00:17:22,319
Go on, get going. The teacher is coming.

250
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,920
So cute.

251
00:17:26,520 --> 00:17:27,880
Kids, what are you doing?

252
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:29,200
That's enough.

253
00:17:35,520 --> 00:17:37,240
Hello, everyone.

254
00:17:37,320 --> 00:17:39,920
Class, please stand and greet.

255
00:17:40,800 --> 00:17:43,440
- Good morning, Teacher.
- Good morning, Teacher.

256
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,760
Hello.

257
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:46,440
My name is Aom.

258
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:48,880
I'll be your homeroom teacher this year.

259
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,560
Class 4/11, Science-Math.

260
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,640
Most of you already know each other,

261
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:57,720
since you continued here after Grade 9.

262
00:17:57,800 --> 00:18:02,240
But this year is special,
because we have male students joining us.

263
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,880
I'd like everyone to introduce yourselves

264
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:08,280
and tell us what you hope
to get out of this school year.

265
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:09,680
Let's start with you.

266
00:18:11,560 --> 00:18:14,800
Hello, I'm Pimploy,
and I want to be a teacher.

267
00:18:23,800 --> 00:18:26,880
Hello, I'm Min,
and I want to be a fujoshi.

268
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:30,680
Hello, I'm Yihwa.

269
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:32,480
I want to be an actress.

270
00:18:33,520 --> 00:18:36,920
Damn, everyone here
has such strong personalities.

271
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:39,360
Gorgeous. Adorable.

272
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,960
They're all amazing.

273
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:43,240
You're right.

274
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:46,200
Maybe they all got
glow-ups over the break.

275
00:18:46,720 --> 00:18:49,040
Damn, this is such a culture shock.

276
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:50,280
Too many new things.

277
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:56,160
What about those two young men?

278
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:57,760
Oh, me?

279
00:18:59,040 --> 00:19:00,440
She's asking you to introduce yourself

280
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:04,280
and tell us what you hope
to get out of studying here.

281
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:07,720
My name's Indy.

282
00:19:07,800 --> 00:19:09,320
Ekkachat.

283
00:19:09,400 --> 00:19:10,560
Well…

284
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:13,480
I don't really have any expectations yet.

285
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:17,000
I just hope to find true love.

286
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:21,000
That's enough.

287
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:22,600
What about the other guy?

288
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,440
My name is Lee.

289
00:19:30,040 --> 00:19:31,880
My friend likes to call me LeeIth

290
00:19:31,960 --> 00:19:34,320
because there were several Lees
at my old school.

291
00:19:34,920 --> 00:19:37,680
And it comes from my real name, Ithadon.

292
00:19:37,760 --> 00:19:42,680
As for my expectations,
I don't have any yet.

293
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:46,560
That's okay.

294
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:49,120
We still have
three years to find ourselves.

295
00:19:49,200 --> 00:19:52,360
Everyone, since this is the first year

296
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:53,840
- our school has admitted male…
- Damn.

297
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:57,520
I feel so out of place.

298
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:59,200
Just stick it out.

299
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:00,160
You'll get used to it.

300
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:03,440
The boys' restroom is
in another building, so plan ahead.

301
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,600
- Let's eat.
- Let's go eat.

302
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:42,360
They're here.

303
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,120
Let's eat.

304
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:02,000
- It's been so long since we last met.
- They're here.

305
00:21:04,400 --> 00:21:06,160
- I missed you.
- Me too.

306
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:08,960
Do you know them?

307
00:21:09,480 --> 00:21:11,440
They're ProudSummer.

308
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:12,560
Where did you hear that?

309
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:17,600
Their confession video from last year
went totally viral.

310
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:18,960
Could you be my girlfriend?

311
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:22,760
PROUD.LYP - SSSSSUMMERRR.R

312
00:21:26,360 --> 00:21:29,480
So, what are your names?

313
00:21:30,240 --> 00:21:31,960
My name's Indy.

314
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:39,760
LeeIth.

315
00:21:51,760 --> 00:21:54,680
- You eat a lot.
- Hey, do you guys have Instagram?

316
00:21:54,760 --> 00:21:56,480
Yeah, we do.

317
00:21:58,080 --> 00:22:00,080
Okay, follow me and I'll follow you back.

318
00:22:00,760 --> 00:22:02,000
No, thanks.

319
00:22:02,760 --> 00:22:04,040
No need to waste a follow on me.

320
00:22:07,640 --> 00:22:08,920
Hey, we're friends now.

321
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,200
Don't worry about follower counts.

322
00:22:10,280 --> 00:22:11,320
That's silly.

323
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:17,800
Hey, hey, hey.

324
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:20,720
I just bought a new lipstick yesterday.

325
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:22,360
The color is gorgeous.

326
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:24,120
Want to try it? Pretty, right?

327
00:22:24,200 --> 00:22:25,400
Want to try it?

328
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,440
Sure.

329
00:22:29,040 --> 00:22:30,760
What's with you?

330
00:22:30,840 --> 00:22:33,040
Friends are supposed to share.

331
00:22:41,880 --> 00:22:43,280
Oh, right.

332
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:44,960
Can I ask you something?

333
00:22:45,800 --> 00:22:48,080
You guys eat so slowly.

334
00:22:48,800 --> 00:22:49,840
Do you even finish
before lunch break is over?

335
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:52,520
We're not eating slowly.

336
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:55,200
We're already full.
We're just chatting now.

337
00:22:56,520 --> 00:22:59,160
Do people play sports here during lunch?

338
00:23:02,640 --> 00:23:03,480
Sports?

339
00:23:11,160 --> 00:23:12,120
Damn.

340
00:23:13,400 --> 00:23:15,360
Girls play basketball these days?

341
00:23:16,080 --> 00:23:17,800
That's news to me too.

342
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:24,920
This court is already full.

343
00:23:25,000 --> 00:23:26,560
But I think that old hoop over there…

344
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:28,800
might suit you better.

345
00:23:39,520 --> 00:23:40,840
Want to play a game?

346
00:23:44,760 --> 00:23:45,960
This basketball stinks.

347
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:49,760
Damn. It really stinks.

348
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:51,080
I'm not playing.

349
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:53,400
I'm saving my fingers for my keyboard.

350
00:23:53,920 --> 00:23:54,960
See you.

351
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:07,400
Can I have the ball back?

352
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:19,360
Sure, Sis. I'll get it for you.

353
00:24:44,840 --> 00:24:45,960
Hey, pass the ball.

354
00:24:48,600 --> 00:24:50,080
What's up, man?

355
00:24:51,560 --> 00:24:52,600
Do I know you?

356
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:56,760
I saw you asking for
Putter's IG this morning.

357
00:24:56,840 --> 00:24:58,280
I'm Tungtae from Class 12.

358
00:25:01,120 --> 00:25:02,480
I'm LeeIth from Class 11.

359
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:08,400
No need to introduce yourself.

360
00:25:08,480 --> 00:25:09,840
Everyone knows who you are.

361
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,120
What did I even do?

362
00:25:20,200 --> 00:25:22,400
It's because you're handsome.

363
00:25:23,920 --> 00:25:25,200
That's why everyone knows you.

364
00:25:25,280 --> 00:25:27,960
In that case, let me get your IG.
Let's be friends.

365
00:25:28,600 --> 00:25:30,720
There are so few male students
at our school.

366
00:25:31,240 --> 00:25:32,880
I'm still adjusting too.

367
00:25:33,680 --> 00:25:34,800
We can stick together.

368
00:25:34,880 --> 00:25:36,440
We can help each other out.

369
00:25:44,760 --> 00:25:45,640
What?

370
00:25:45,720 --> 00:25:46,560
LEEIT.TARADON

371
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,160
You only have 60 followers?

372
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,360
Yeah.

373
00:25:50,440 --> 00:25:52,080
I don't like people
paying attention to me.

374
00:25:53,800 --> 00:25:55,440
You're such a fanfic protagonist.

375
00:25:55,520 --> 00:25:56,960
I followed you already.

376
00:25:57,640 --> 00:25:58,640
Okay.

377
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:04,920
Damn, you have 20,000 followers?

378
00:26:05,760 --> 00:26:06,760
Yep.

379
00:26:07,560 --> 00:26:08,680
I'll text you later.

380
00:26:09,280 --> 00:26:11,120
- See you around.
- Wait, wait, wait.

381
00:26:11,640 --> 00:26:12,520
Wanna play basketball?

382
00:26:12,600 --> 00:26:13,880
- Hey.
- Want to play?

383
00:26:13,960 --> 00:26:16,280
Maybe later. I've got content to make.

384
00:26:16,360 --> 00:26:18,640
And lunchtime is prime time.

385
00:26:19,480 --> 00:26:20,440
See you.

386
00:26:21,600 --> 00:26:24,320
Hello, everyone. Tungtae is back again.

387
00:26:26,320 --> 00:26:27,400
Damn.

388
00:26:28,440 --> 00:26:29,520
That's so cool.

389
00:26:51,800 --> 00:26:53,920
See that? See that?

390
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:55,640
That's my friend.

391
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,800
Hey, hey, hey.

392
00:26:57,880 --> 00:26:59,120
Look at him.

393
00:26:59,200 --> 00:27:01,000
There.

394
00:27:01,080 --> 00:27:02,520
Look, he made the shot.

395
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,760
See?

396
00:27:04,840 --> 00:27:05,840
Isn't he cool?

397
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,160
Tell me.

398
00:27:07,240 --> 00:27:08,760
Say something to the camera.

399
00:27:23,480 --> 00:27:25,520
Damn.

400
00:27:42,000 --> 00:27:43,720
Damn, my homework.

401
00:27:43,800 --> 00:27:45,160
He's pissed.

402
00:27:45,240 --> 00:27:47,000
Shit, shit.

403
00:27:47,080 --> 00:27:50,440
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

404
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:51,800
But…

405
00:27:51,880 --> 00:27:53,280
you should've watched
where you were sitting.

406
00:27:53,360 --> 00:27:55,560
This is a public area, isn't it?

407
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:57,920
How was I supposed to know
a basketball would fly over?

408
00:27:58,520 --> 00:27:59,720
I'm sorry.

409
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:04,880
Damn.

410
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:06,520
Are you messing with me?

411
00:28:08,680 --> 00:28:10,360
I didn't mean to.

412
00:28:16,440 --> 00:28:18,520
So annoying.

413
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:22,040
I was just trying to help.

414
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:25,480
Do you know

415
00:28:25,560 --> 00:28:28,600
what it's called when you jump in
to help without being asked?

416
00:28:29,800 --> 00:28:30,640
Are you calling me nosy?

417
00:28:32,080 --> 00:28:33,000
Your words, not mine.

418
00:28:34,000 --> 00:28:35,000
What the hell?

419
00:28:35,080 --> 00:28:36,520
I was just trying to help.

420
00:28:36,600 --> 00:28:38,160
With that calm face and sweet smile,

421
00:28:38,240 --> 00:28:40,040
I didn't expect you to talk like that.

422
00:28:40,120 --> 00:28:41,720
Talk like what?

423
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:44,840
Sorry, but whether I look cold or sweet,

424
00:28:44,920 --> 00:28:46,280
I can say whatever I want.

425
00:28:46,360 --> 00:28:47,880
Don't stereotype me.

426
00:28:48,800 --> 00:28:50,680
Talking like you're educating people…

427
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:51,800
Are you some kind of
social justice warrior?

428
00:28:51,880 --> 00:28:53,520
Someone like you needs educating.

429
00:28:53,600 --> 00:28:55,040
So you'll know what's what.

430
00:28:56,520 --> 00:28:59,120
I've met plenty of people like you.

431
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,960
You're only brave behind a screen.

432
00:29:01,040 --> 00:29:02,560
You'd never dare say that to my face.

433
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:03,720
You think I wouldn't dare?

434
00:29:13,360 --> 00:29:14,240
Shit.

435
00:29:14,320 --> 00:29:15,760
Shit!

436
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:23,120
Hey, hey, hey!

437
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:25,200
- That's enough. Stop.
- Hey, stop, stop.

438
00:29:25,280 --> 00:29:25,960
Enough.

439
00:29:26,040 --> 00:29:27,040
- Calm down.
- Putter.

440
00:29:27,120 --> 00:29:28,400
- Come on then.
- Calm down.

441
00:29:28,480 --> 00:29:30,760
- Hear me? Don't walk away.
- Putter, enough.

442
00:29:30,840 --> 00:29:32,240
- Think you're tough, asshole?
- Come on.

443
00:29:51,240 --> 00:29:53,560
<i>What is this?</i>

444
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:56,640
- <i>What is this?</i>
- <i>What's wrong?</i>

445
00:29:56,720 --> 00:29:57,760
<i>What the hell?</i>

446
00:29:58,880 --> 00:30:00,120
Mom, what are you doing?

447
00:30:00,200 --> 00:30:02,080
I'm watching a vertical drama.

448
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:05,120
I was wondering
who would come save the heroine.

449
00:30:06,040 --> 00:30:07,440
How was your day, sweetheart?

450
00:30:07,520 --> 00:30:09,240
Did you enjoy your first day at school?

451
00:30:10,160 --> 00:30:11,880
If you want to know, just look at me.

452
00:30:13,760 --> 00:30:14,720
Wow.

453
00:30:14,800 --> 00:30:16,120
You look like a mess.

454
00:30:16,880 --> 00:30:18,120
Don't bully me.

455
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:20,200
And don't try to educate me.

456
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,600
Ugh, can you stop using that word?

457
00:30:23,640 --> 00:30:26,120
That's just how it is
on your first day at a new school.

458
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:27,920
You'll adjust.

459
00:30:29,880 --> 00:30:32,600
Well… It's not just that.

460
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:35,360
I guess it's culture shock.

461
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,600
I didn't think an all-girls school
would be this intense.

462
00:30:38,520 --> 00:30:41,320
Some of the guys are totally weird too.

463
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:53,960
Mom, Dad.

464
00:30:54,040 --> 00:30:55,720
Can I ask you something?

465
00:31:00,560 --> 00:31:01,800
Can I move into a condo?

466
00:31:03,520 --> 00:31:04,480
No.

467
00:31:04,560 --> 00:31:06,840
If you live alone,
who's going to take care of you?

468
00:31:07,360 --> 00:31:09,840
It'll help me learn
to take care of myself.

469
00:31:10,360 --> 00:31:11,840
Look at Indy.

470
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,840
His parents even bought him a condo.

471
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:15,240
I could stay with him.

472
00:31:15,320 --> 00:31:17,120
That's even worse.

473
00:31:17,200 --> 00:31:18,480
If you two live together,

474
00:31:18,560 --> 00:31:21,600
you'll just skip class for band practice
and neglect your studies again.

475
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,440
Come on, Mom.

476
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:24,760
Am I wrong?

477
00:31:25,560 --> 00:31:28,240
Cut back on the band practice, LeeIth.

478
00:31:28,320 --> 00:31:31,000
Focus on your studies
and get into a good university first.

479
00:31:31,080 --> 00:31:32,680
There'll still be time to start a band.

480
00:31:32,760 --> 00:31:35,640
By then,
your face will have matured nicely.

481
00:31:35,720 --> 00:31:36,960
Trust me.

482
00:31:38,080 --> 00:31:39,880
But you're only young once, Mom.

483
00:31:41,360 --> 00:31:42,800
Just wait until you get in.

484
00:31:42,880 --> 00:31:44,280
If you end up at a bad university,

485
00:31:44,360 --> 00:31:46,320
you'll be the one regretting it later.

486
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:48,400
I've still got three years, Mom.

487
00:31:48,480 --> 00:31:50,280
It's only three years, LeeIth.

488
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:54,720
Getting into this school
still isn't enough for you?

489
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:12,760
Our son is so dramatic.

490
00:32:57,560 --> 00:33:03,000
THIS PROFILE IS PRIVATE

491
00:33:38,280 --> 00:33:39,280
What are you looking at?

492
00:33:40,760 --> 00:33:42,640
Move. I need to dry my hands.

493
00:34:05,040 --> 00:34:06,120
LeeIth.

494
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:08,000
Have you joined a club yet?

495
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,800
Let me join you.

496
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,239
Why don't you go with your friend?

497
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:17,639
He said he's joining the e-sports club.

498
00:34:18,719 --> 00:34:19,760
But that's not my vibe.

499
00:34:19,840 --> 00:34:21,280
E-SPORT CLUB

500
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,440
Come on, let's look around.

501
00:34:36,159 --> 00:34:37,520
What's gotten into you?

502
00:34:38,400 --> 00:34:40,840
How about we join
the traditional Thai dance club?

503
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,639
Did you drop this?

504
00:34:55,520 --> 00:34:58,000
- How about the sports club?
- No way, that's exhausting.

505
00:34:59,160 --> 00:35:01,200
What about the Buddhist club?

506
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:03,160
No thanks, I'm not ready for nirvana.

507
00:35:08,160 --> 00:35:09,480
Art.

508
00:35:12,360 --> 00:35:13,760
Nope.

509
00:35:13,840 --> 00:35:15,720
I've never drawn anything in my life.

510
00:35:16,600 --> 00:35:17,640
Chess.

511
00:35:20,720 --> 00:35:22,360
Nah, it gives me a headache.

512
00:35:22,440 --> 00:35:23,680
Want to fight me or what?

513
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:25,960
You don't want this, you don't want that.

514
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:27,080
So what do you want?

515
00:35:28,840 --> 00:35:30,440
I don't know either.

516
00:35:38,720 --> 00:35:41,160
What I was hoping for…

517
00:35:41,240 --> 00:35:42,200
I haven't found it yet.

518
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,960
I seriously feel like an outsider.

519
00:35:44,560 --> 00:35:46,760
There are so few
male students at this school.

520
00:35:46,840 --> 00:35:48,080
I'm still trying to adjust too.

521
00:35:48,160 --> 00:35:49,600
We can stick together.

522
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:50,800
We can help each other out.

523
00:35:51,880 --> 00:35:52,880
Oh.

524
00:35:53,560 --> 00:35:54,920
How about this?

525
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:03,880
Teacher. We'd like to start a club.

526
00:36:04,920 --> 00:36:07,320
It'll bring the male students together,

527
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:10,080
so we can support each other
and adjust together.

528
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:11,280
That's right, Teacher.

529
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:14,520
That's quite unique and interesting.

530
00:36:14,600 --> 00:36:16,720
And what would the club's achievement be?

531
00:36:20,040 --> 00:36:21,080
Achievement?

532
00:36:21,160 --> 00:36:22,560
Do we need one?

533
00:36:22,640 --> 00:36:23,480
Of course.

534
00:36:23,560 --> 00:36:26,680
It has to be something
measurable and assessable,

535
00:36:26,760 --> 00:36:30,720
with room to grow,
and contribute to society.

536
00:36:32,760 --> 00:36:34,000
What should we do?

537
00:36:34,720 --> 00:36:35,760
I don't know.

538
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:41,600
Could happiness count?

539
00:36:44,960 --> 00:36:46,000
I think you'd better

540
00:36:46,080 --> 00:36:49,200
come back with a proposal
that actually works.

541
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:55,880
Teacher.

542
00:36:56,800 --> 00:36:59,880
Our club is about gender equality.

543
00:36:59,960 --> 00:37:01,960
DEMOGRAPHIC CHALLENGES

544
00:37:02,600 --> 00:37:03,440
Hold this.

545
00:37:05,040 --> 00:37:06,440
The issue we're facing is that

546
00:37:06,520 --> 00:37:09,000
male students
are a minority at this school.

547
00:37:09,080 --> 00:37:11,920
So our club
will encourage all male students

548
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:14,240
to connect with female students
in a friendly way.

549
