- "Let's build our community."

734
00:47:33,720 --> 00:47:35,640
- "To be strong as a rock."
- "To be strong as a rock."

735
00:47:42,600 --> 00:47:46,680
Our mission is to promote gender equality

736
00:47:46,760 --> 00:47:50,240
