756
00:48:51,640 --> 00:48:53,480
We're a gender-related club, right?

757
00:48:53,560 --> 00:48:55,560
It doesn't have to be sex education.

758
00:48:55,640 --> 00:48:57,920
We'll do gender education instead.

759
00:48:58,000 --> 00:49:00,840
