766
00:49:14,320 --> 00:49:16,480
- Starting with you.
- This guy?

767
00:49:19,600 --> 00:49:21,680
You, go ahead.

768
00:49:21,760 --> 00:49:23,240
- Go on.
- You're our case study.

769
00:49:23,320 --> 00:49:25,120
Starting with you.

770
00:49:25,200 --> 00:49:26,960
