777
00:49:41,680 --> 00:49:45,040
<i>We'll infiltrate</i>
<i>the traditional Thai dance club.</i>

778
00:49:47,400 --> 00:49:48,400
Hello.

779
00:49:48,480 --> 00:49:51,520
We're from the Awkward Today,
Normal Tomorrow Club,

780
00:49:51,600 --> 00:49:52,760
or "You'll Get Used to It" Club.

781
00:49:52,840 --> 00:49:55,320
