and learn everything about Faye.

785
00:50:01,920 --> 00:50:02,880
Faye?

786
00:50:02,960 --> 00:50:05,920
Her family runs a bakery,
selling cookies and things like that.

787
00:50:06,000 --> 00:50:08,360
