788
00:50:08,440 --> 00:50:10,400
And she still doesn't have a boyfriend.

789
00:50:10,480 --> 00:50:13,200
I guess her standards are just too high.

790
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:15,480
She's also an idol to the younger students

791
00:50:15,560 --> 00:50:17,720
because she's a top student,
great at sports,

792
00:50:17,800 --> 00:50:20,240
and active in school activities too.

793
00:50:31,800 --> 00:50:35,160
What does Faye like to eat,
and where does she live?

794
00:50:47,560 --> 00:50:48,880
Next, we'll make our move

795
00:50:48,960 --> 00:50:49,960
