in Faye's dance club.

797
00:50:52,800 --> 00:50:55,000
Alright, I'll pair everyone up.

798
00:50:55,080 --> 00:50:57,560
Starting with…

799
00:50:58,160 --> 00:50:59,440
You two are together.

800
00:50:59,520 --> 00:51:01,160
