809
00:51:20,360 --> 00:51:22,360
You think you're the only one
who wants to switch?

810
00:51:24,080 --> 00:51:25,320
I was just asking.

811
00:51:26,080 --> 00:51:27,560
In case you didn't want
to be paired with me.

812
00:51:28,840 --> 00:51:29,800
You're right, I don't.

813
00:51:31,080 --> 00:51:32,440
